Voidbound Third-Party Notices
=============================

This file lists the third-party software used by the Voidbound game
binary, along with their respective licenses. It is generated
automatically by `cargo-about` from `src-tauri/Cargo.lock` and is
required for compliance with the licenses of those third-party
projects (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, Zlib, etc.).

If you fork this project and modify dependencies, regenerate this
file by running:

    cd src-tauri
    cargo install cargo-about --features cli   # one-time
    cargo about generate about-md.hbs -o ../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

Last generated: see git log for `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`

